---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.svelte';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.svelte';
---

<Layout>
    <Nav client:load />
    <main class="legal-page">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="updated">Last updated: January 24, 2026</p>

            <section>
                <h2>The Service</h2>
                <p>PreFlight ("we", "us") provides automated App Store submission review services. We analyze your app metadata, screenshots, privacy manifests, and related files against Apple's published App Store Review Guidelines to identify potential rejection risks.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>No Guarantee of Approval</h2>
                <p>PreFlight is a risk assessment tool, not a guarantee. Apple's App Review process involves human reviewers making subjective decisions. While we check against 50+ known rejection patterns, we cannot guarantee your app will be approved. Our service reduces risk but does not eliminate it.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Payments</h2>
                <p>Reviews are priced per submission ($29 for Quick Review, $49 for Full Review). Payments are processed through Stripe. All sales are final once a review has been generated. If our service fails to produce a report due to a technical error on our end, you will receive a full refund.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Your Content</h2>
                <p>You retain all rights to your app data, screenshots, and submission materials. By uploading content for review, you grant us a temporary, limited license to process it for the sole purpose of generating your report. We delete submission files within 24 hours of review completion.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
                <p>You agree not to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Submit content that violates applicable laws.</li>
                    <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer our review engine.</li>
                    <li>Use automated systems to submit bulk reviews without prior arrangement.</li>
                    <li>Share your account credentials with others.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
                <p>PreFlight's liability is limited to the amount you paid for the specific review in question. We are not liable for any damages resulting from app rejections, delayed launches, or lost revenue, regardless of whether you used our service.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
                <p>We may update these terms as our service evolves. Significant changes will be communicated via email to registered users. Continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Contact</h2>
                <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@mypreflight.app">hello@mypreflight.app</a>.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
    <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-page {
        padding: 140px 0 80px;
    }

    .legal-page .container {
        max-width: 700px;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .updated {
        color: var(--gray-500);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    section {
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--gray-100);
    }

    p, li {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: var(--gray-300);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
        margin-top: 8px;
    }

    li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    a {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }

    a:hover {
        color: var(--accent-hover);
    }
</style>
